sequenceDiagram
    participant P as NewComer
    participant B as Bootstrap Node
    participant N as Network

    P ->> B: CHALLENGE_REQUEST
    note right of B: enclave_pub_key

    B -->> P: CHALLENGE_RESPONSE
    note left of P: { challenge, difficulty }

    rect rgb(200, 230, 220)
        note over P: TEE enclave
        P ->> P: Compute PoW + sign with TEE key
    end

    P ->> B: JOIN_REQUEST
    note right of B: { pow, sig(pow ‖ enclave_quote ‖ version ‖ challenge),<br/>enclave_quote, version, challenge }

    B ->> B: Verify enclave_quote vs manifest
    note right of B: manifest = { allowed_versions: hashes }
    B ->> B: Check version vs allowed_versions
    B ->> B: Verify PoW sig vs TEE pubkey
    note right of B: pub_key extracted from enclave_quote.user_data<br/>assert SHA256(pub_key) == user_data

    B ->> P: JOIN_ACCEPT
    note over P,N: { token[newcomer_quote, issuer_quote,<br/>issued_at, expire_at, challenge, sig(all fields)] }

    P ->> P: Verify issuer_quote vs binary manifest
    note over P,N: hardcoded fingerprint = { addr, enclave_hash,<br/>hash(pub_key), pub_key, enclave_sig }<br/>or .torrent nodes key

    P ->> P: Extract pub_key from issuer_quote.user_data
    P ->> P: Verify token.signature vs issuer pub_key
    note over P: token integrity and issuer authentication confirmed

    P ->> N: FIND_NODE(own_pub_key)
    N -->> P: k nearest nodes

    note over P: DHT active
